---@field capabilities anthropic.models.ModelCapabilities|distilled.Null Object mapping capability names to their support details. Keys are always present for all known capabilities.
---@field created_at string RFC 3339 datetime string representing the time at which the model was released. May be set to an epoch value if the release date is unknown.
